Brown[ Bag has] played shows at The Beverly Arts Center,[ Wh]ippersnap Music Fest 2012,[ Shoe]Fest 2012,[ Martyr]�[�s], Tonic Room, Ace Bar, Reggie’s, Harte�[�s] and host their own annual festival, �[�O]ink Fest”[ plus] numerous[ more.]
